Script To Display System Information

1 Get-ComputerInfo | Select-Object WindowsProductName, Windows Version, CsName, CsManufacturer, CsModel


Scrip to check Disk Space

1 Get-Volume |

2 Select DriveLetter,

3 @{Name="SizeGB"; Expression={:Round($_.Size/1GB,2)}},

4 @{Name="FreeGB"; Expression={:Round($_.SizeRemaining/1GB,2)}}



Script to Check CPU and Memory

1 Get-CimInstance Win32_OperatingSystem |

2 Select-Object @{Name="TotalRAM (GB)"; Expression= {:Round($`_.TotalVisibleMemorySize/1MB, 2)}},

3 @{Name="FreeRAM (GB)"; Expression={:Round(`$_.FreePhysicalMemory/1MB,2)}}




